WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Once upon a time, in a faraway land,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.680
there was a barbaric, ruthless, defiant,

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.490
demon-like bastard who thought 
nothing of his fellow man.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.240
Crap, you're growing by the day...

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.330
What? You're hungry?

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.240
Damn, not again...

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.500
I'm sorry, Sir! But you can't 
bring that Demon Lord in here...

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.150
What? You're kiddin' me...

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.260
No. Sir. I'm not.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.640
Please... Anything but that Demon Lord...

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:40.980
Here, too?

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.500
What? A Demon Lord? Not a chance...

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.650
He'll scare away all my customers!

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:50.380
Oh, yeah?!

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.150
What's that noise?

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.160
W-What's that?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.330
It's an earthquake!

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:58.170
Watch out!

00:00:58.170 --> 00:00:59.160
Run for it!

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.130
Hey, what about his grub?

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.300
Hey! Wait, damn it!

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:05.910
Wait!

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.930
Totally wiped out!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:25.190
Phew, a dream... Or wait, a 
premonition of the future?

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:28.050
I gotta do something, and quick!

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:33.240
I'm dumping this little guy onto some 
barbaric, ruthless, defiant bastard,

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:36.050
who thinks nothing of his fellow man!

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:42.720
This is a tale of a delinquent 
high-school student who,

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.850
through some strange circumstance, 
is raising a child.

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:50.940
However that baby is not a normal 
baby, but in fact a baby Demon Lord!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:36.980
<b>Are there any strong, ruthless bastards around here?</b>

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.540
Look here. Did you really 
understand all that?

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:45.150
Yeah... Feed him five times a day, right?

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.850
This is 3 portions worth.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:47.990
Don't forget it.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.000
Milk those udders of yours?

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.500
It is powdered milk suitable for royalty.

00:03:55.350 --> 00:03:57.630
So your boobs are all dried up?

00:03:59.360 --> 00:03:59.980
Listen up.

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:03.650
The milk should be the temperature 
of the underarm of a wyvern

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:06.390
that lives on Midloche 
lake in the Demon World.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.890
How the hell should I know that?

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.880
Oh? Then perhaps I should come with you?

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:14.140
Idiot. Just leave it to me.

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.410
I'll trust you at your word.

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:22.900
Powdered milk? I can handle that no sweat.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:24.860
Ain't that right, Baby Beel?

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.970
If you're hungry, just say so!

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:37.220
Here.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:43.220
Taste good?

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.000
What is <i>that</i>?

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.710
Drinking milk on the ground like that?

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:49.550
That's just unheard of...

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.100
Well, excuse <i>me</i>.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:01.640
Damn, you sure wasted a 
bunch of my time here.

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:03.860
Now then, off we go!

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:07.660
Listening? No more crying, 'kay?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:18.630
Maybe I should ask... Are you okay there?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.500
Okay?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.050
Do I look okay?

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.450
No, you don't.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:29.770
Hilda said 5 times a day was 
enough, but it's not even close!

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.130
What are you doing?

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:34.280
Looking for Baby Beel's food...

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:35.470
Gone!

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:36.550
What?

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:39.770
I'm tellin' you! It's the 
powdered milk for royalty!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.170
Don't cry!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.590
Hey! I'm gonna search for milk!

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:45.970
Rock Baby Beel in your arms for me!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:49.260
In my arms? But I've never 
looked after a baby before...

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:53.780
Looky! Doodleoodledoo, and to you!

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.540
How was that?

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.830
Why are you here?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.580
About that...

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.300
Have a listen.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:11.050
So you see, starting today, I 
will be living here in your care.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:15.480
My name is Bathym de Alaindelon.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:19.400
Please think of me as your new son.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.500
Wha...? Hold it!

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.070
You just showed up out of the blue... 
What do you mean "so you see"?

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:29.160
Even after all that you did, you're still...

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:30.800
You did?

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.330
Did that?

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.590
Did what?

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.840
That's totally not it!

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.700
Stop imagining something so horrid!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:39.580
No, you see...

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.840
I must find a home to take 
me in like Hilda-sama did.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:44.980
Although...

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.590
I am greatly concerned about 
living in the same house as them.

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:51.590
So, when I thought to myself I should borrow 
someone's house, I then chose my mark...

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.100
Your mark?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:57.600
I felt it the other day 
when you were inside of me.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.980
You are a man with a hot, 
burning passion! Yes!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.360
If it is him, I can give 
myself to him completely!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.240
Felt...

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.370
...inside of him?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.900
Burning passion?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.580
Nooo!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.660
Takayuki, explain what's going on!

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:25.140
Son, you disappoint me!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.670
Head upstairs now, Dear.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.620
Aww... I wanna hear more! It's funny.

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.680
What a lovely family you have!

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.460
This is no time for laughter!

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.150
And, well, that happened, see.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:42.930
Shit!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.430
I totally dropped them 
or left them somewhere!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:48.610
At least pretend to listen.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.670
Whatever! What am I gonna do about the milk?

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.280
Oh, this will not do.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:58.540
How about I, Alaindelon, be of assistance!

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:05.170
As if!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:08.620
Oh? You are going to take up the 
challenge yourself, Furuichi-sama?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.690
Here, yes?

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.300
Or perhaps here?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:14.050
Maybe here?

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:19.310
Why isn't Hilda-san here when we need her?

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:27.510
I really don't feel right 
here in the Human World.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:30.050
I hate how stiff my shoulders get.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.600
Hang in there for a little bit longer!

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.200
I'm sure the vending machines had...

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.710
The vending machine corner...

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.330
Please let there be normal milk...

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.420
Bingo!

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.420
<b>Yummer's Milk</b>

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:52.600
<b>Sold Out</b>

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.340
There's got to... got to be 
something instead of milk!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.480
Coffee? Fruit drinks?

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.730
Lamune? Green juice?

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.280
Green juice! How about that, Baby Beel?

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.560
Ack! Don't cry! Don't cry!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.270
Something else kinda like milk...

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.110
Something milk-ish...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.700
What's with you?

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:28.210
Oh, sorry. It's an emergency.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:29.900
Emergency my ass!

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.210
There ain't none for you, punk!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.180
I <i>said</i> it was an emergency!

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:43.330
All set?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.880
What? You want more?

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:52.910
I gotta do something quick, or it's not just 
my body, but my wallet that'll be in trouble.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.990
Oh, you've done it now, buddy.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.740
Buyin' out Kanzaki-san's yogurt like that?

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.990
You won't walk away with just a 
couple of bruises this time, idiot.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:10.000
You know how many people Kanzaki's 
kicks have put in the hospital by now?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:14.000
And there were guys who had 
their face bones so shattered

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.790
they came out lookin' like 
an entirely different dude.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:23.970
If there's a guy more barbaric than me who 
Baby Beel can get attached to, then I'm free!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:29.730
Would you tell me where I can 
meet this Kanzaki-kun fellow?

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:39.990
So, you guys were easily shaken 
down by this Oga fellow?

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:42.700
It wasn't that simple...

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.460
He's a damn monster!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.700
He can run faster than 50 km/h!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.130
And he's friends with this weird big dude.

00:10:49.130 --> 00:10:52.840
Plus, he's got one scary chick with him.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.830
Enough, I understand.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:57.200
Then... We can go now, right?

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:02.090
You second years are all worthless cowards!

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:13.370
He's strong...

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:16.160
Yup, he's a third year...

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.530
He's worse than... Oga...

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:21.080
Good... night...

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.500
Oga, huh?

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.400
Huh?

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.900
Look at that!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.900
W-Why is that guy here?

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.210
He's a first year, right?

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:54.650
N-No way...

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.170
He's on a roll after wiping 
out the second years...

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.280
...and come to beat the crap 
out of the third year class?

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.660
That ain't good, man!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.380
Idiot! Does he think the third 
years will let that stand?

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:04.540
He's comin' this way!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.150
Crap!

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:06.550
Don't make eye contact.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:09.720
Hey, there! Sorry 'bout this...

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:11.040
Yes?

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.790
Where's the class with this Kazaki person?

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.800
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.980
Sorry!

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:29.470
Are you sure about this, Kanzaki-san?

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.280
About what?

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.530
This first year kid, Oga,

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:40.400
has been goin' around askin' who the 
strongest is in the school, or so I hear.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:46.660
I think maybe it's best to 
crush him quickly, or else...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.500
Amazing...

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.280
A drop kick?

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:01.800
On that giant Shiroyama-san?

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.010
He's strong... He's way too strong!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.510
Good... night...

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:12.270
Look, Shiroyama. You think 
I'll lose to some first year?

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.770
That's right, Shiro-chan.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:16.940
Natsume...

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.860
Kanzaki-kun isn't going 
to lose. You know that.

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:23.110
And there ain't anyone that'll 
challenge him in the first place.

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:28.530
Now then, I have to clean up the trash first.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.890
Just one kick...

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:32.890
And we're all...

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:33.980
Whoa...

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.000
Goodnight.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.400
There you go again, Kanzaki-kun.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:42.010
And anyone who picks a fight with Kanzaki-kun

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:45.600
picks a fight with the bulk 
of the third years, you know.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:48.760
Only a completely hopeless 
fool would do that.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.980
Indeed.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.020
Even in this school, no one is that...

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:53.020
Howdy there!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.730
Is Kanzaki-kun here?

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.390
...I stand corrected.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.970
He's the one the rumors...

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:00.120
Oga?

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:01.400
Why is he here?

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.340
This is Kanzaki-kun's class, right?

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:06.900
I got the wrong room?

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.000
That's Kanzaki"-san" to 
you, little first year.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.280
Oh, so <i>you're</i> Kanazaki-kun?

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.700
I mean... -san?

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:15.410
Yes.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.560
Jackpot!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.000
Just look how evil and dangerous this guy is!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.170
I bet this guy...

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:24.710
He's fricken smilin'...

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.170
His expression is creepin' me out...

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.960
That's some confidence he has.

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:31.900
Kanzaki-san, this bastard cut in 
line for the vending machines!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.980
Of your favorite, "Yogurty"!

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.930
He bought all of them!

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:39.260
That's some guts you got.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.940
You <i>tryin'</i> to piss us off or what?

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:53.780
"I have no use for small-fry 
like you. Beat it," he said.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.450
Say what? You little...

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.730
Shiroyama-san...

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.830
So you're Oga? I've heard the rumors.

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.660
What do you want with Kanzaki-san?

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.080
What do I want?

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.420
Well, I...

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.450
Wait. How should I go about this?

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:15.540
I can't just be all "Here, have this baby!"

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:17.470
Em...

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:18.640
Here!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.610
Thank you!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.950
How should I do this?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.550
U-Uh... I...

00:15:27.550 --> 00:15:29.380
What are you blabbering on about?

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.930
We apologize!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:37.120
We actually came to offer our services to 
Kanzaki-san, who is known for being so super strong!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:37.690
Right?

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:38.570
What?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.580
Oh, don't mind him!

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:46.130
Are you completely dense? Can't 
you sense how dangerous this is?

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:49.510
We gotta at least say 
something like this for now!

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:52.510
You want to offer your 
services to him? Really?

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.080
Uh, well...

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.190
Sure, whatever.

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:57.220
Be polite!

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.270
That is the case as it were!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.910
Work for Kanzaki-san?

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.270
Yeah, he's powerful, but...

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.110
Can we trust him?

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.430
And he calls that being polite?

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.850
Interesting.

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.030
I always welcome the strong.

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.050
Yeah, that!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:18.040
Wait! We can't just believe him...

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:22.450
And besides, we can't know if he's really 
strong just from what those second years said.

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:26.540
Then you can prove it yourself, Shiroyama.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.540
Proof?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:33.080
I have no need for someone not 
even strong enough to beat you.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:37.100
U-Understood.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:39.310
There you have it.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:45.800
You'll believe me if I beat you, then?

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.070
What are you up to?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:53.320
I've crushed countless people like you!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:57.290
Punks who tried to get close 
to Kanzaki only to turn on him.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.330
And you'll be no different!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.800
You'll... be...

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.310
You... be?

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.840
Not a hint of holding back, as always.

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:13.980
One sharp punch to the jaw acted like a lever, 
using his forehead to send a shock to the brain.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:15.870
He won't get up anytime soon.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:21.430
And that proves it.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.750
You really are strong.

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.350
Fine then. Welcome to 3-A.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.290
Please, wait!

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.860
I can still fight!

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:35.110
He's got some willpower...

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:39.490
I haven't lost... yet...

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:43.020
As Kanzaki-san's bodyguard...

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.120
I-I'm...

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:54.880
Cool story, bro. But I got 
no more use for you. Beat it.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.130
How cruel! They're on the same side!

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.800
Ooh, nice! Eeeevil!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:05.840
K-Kanzaki-san... He's hiding something.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.770
I can tell... He's dangerous!

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:13.330
For you, Kanzaki-san, I'll do anything...

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:14.540
Oh?

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:15.840
Can you stand?

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.630
O-Of course!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.900
Good, looks like you can stand.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.180
Now, jump out that window.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:50.940
Everyone, give him a round of applause.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.940
Applause!

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:05.450
There you go. Everyone's waiting, 
my pretentious pal Shiroyama-kun.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.710
Come on... That's just...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:13.640
What's the matter? Can 
stand up but can't walk?

00:19:13.640 --> 00:19:16.730
I... For you...

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.040
You're my personal guard. Get to it.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.660
Too bad, then.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:25.220
Hey, Oga! I got you your first job.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.120
Clean up the trash.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:35.450
Don't you get it? I told you to 
throw this punk out the window.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:39.190
No, it isn't you after all.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.570
You, take a flying leap!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:44.700
Oga...

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.290
Vortex Punch!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.380
Hey, Oga...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.880
Did I get 'im?

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:03.140
How dare you...

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:07.890
Yeah, uh, you see... I think 
his hand slipped, and...

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.650
You aren't getting away with this!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:22.450
Poor first year kid...

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:25.320
You can't dodge it.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.250
Ah, yes. You said to clean 
up the trash, right?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:38.710
Oga...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.920
...Hell Throw!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.930
Take a flying leap!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.940
Happy?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.900
Crap... Another failed 
attempt to dump the baby...

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:20.590
My big chance, ruined again.

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:27.520
Well, it was for the best. At least 
you didn't end up that guy's lackey.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.130
This "yogurty" is quite exquisite!

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:34.940
This is no time for taste tests!

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:41.360
Oga-kun, huh?

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:46.140
He seems more interesting than Kanzaki-kun.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:51.340
However I can't think the third years 
will just stand by and let this go.

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:52.870
I wonder what they'll do?

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.130
Baby Beel has been quite exited here...

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.140
It's milk time!

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:14.940
God damn it! I'm gonna dump him 
on someone, somewhere, somehow!

00:24:02.860 --> 00:24:05.490
In life, there are three kinds of hills.

00:24:05.490 --> 00:24:10.530
There's uphill, there's downhill... 
And then there's over-the-hill!

00:24:10.530 --> 00:24:11.930
Good one. Not.

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:14.700
Anyway, Baby Beel won't stop wetting the bed!

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:21.630
On the next Beelzebub: There Is 1 Second 
Before the Demon Lord's Floods Burst Forth

00:24:22.140 --> 00:24:24.150
Guess I have to high-tail it to Macao.

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:25.210
You wouldn't!

00:24:25.210 --> 00:24:26.060
Come on...
